<h2 id="cohomology-section-introduction" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="01DX">20.1</span> Introduction</h2>

<p>
In this document we work out some topics on cohomology of sheaves on topological spaces. We mostly work in the generality of modules over a sheaf of rings and we work with morphisms of ringed spaces. To see what happens for sheaves on sites take a look at the chapter Cohomology on Sites, Section <a href="/tag/01FR" data-tag="01FR">21.1</a>. Basic references are <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Godement">Godement</a>]</span> and <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Iversen">Iversen</a>]</span>. 
</p>
